**Title:** Moonlit Shoreline Serenade

**Description:** Join young Oliver and his wise sea turtle companion, Shelly, as they explore a serene coastal shoreline under the tender light of the moon. As the rhythmic waves kiss the sandy shores and the gentle ocean breeze whispers sweet lullabies, Oliver learns the virtues of patience and acceptance amidst nature's tranquil beauty. This soothing audio journey is crafted to guide listeners into restful sleep, helping to reduce anxiety and foster a sense of emotional calm. Drift into a peaceful slumber with the gentle reminders of the ocean's timeless embrace.

